MILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">변경 후 개인정보 미수정으로 상환관련 안내 누락</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">).</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 15pt; MARGIN: 0pt 0.8pt 4pt 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 15pt; MARGIN: 0pt 0.8pt 4pt 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">재학생들의 학자금대출에 대한 기초지식 함양을 위해 붙임의 자료를 첨부하오니 확인하시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 15pt; MARGIN: 0pt 0.8pt 4pt 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 15pt; MARGIN: 0pt 0.8pt 4pt 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 442pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 53pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN: 0pt 0.8pt 4pt 4.5pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: no